⚠️ IMPORTANT: .env.example CHAHIYE HOTA HAI
Sirf .env ignore karo, lekin .env.example commit karo — taki interviewer samajh sake konsa environment variable chahiye.

Isliye maine .gitignore mein .env likha hai, .env.example nahi likha.

.env.example file banao (backend mein):
text
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./data/app.db
SECRET_KEY=your_secret_key_here
DEBUG=True
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
Aur same frontend ke liye frontend/.env.example:

text
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
VITE_WS_URL=ws://localhost:8000/ws
