🎓 What This Project Demonstrates
This project showcases practical implementation of:

✅ Agentic AI orchestration — multiple LLM agents collaborating

✅ Async Python architecture — FastAPI + asyncio + WebSockets

✅ Full-stack engineering — React + Python + SQL

✅ LLM integration — Google Gemini API in production patterns

✅ Cloud domain knowledge — monitoring, cost, security, scaling

✅ Clean code practices — layered architecture, separation of concerns

✅ Real-time systems — WebSocket streaming

✅ Autonomous decision-making — LLM-driven agent loops

🔮 Future Roadmap
□ Real AWS/GCP/Azure connector
□ Multi-user auth with role-based access
□ Vector DB for agent memory (ChromaDB)
□ RAG-based agent knowledge base
□ Kubernetes operator
□ Slack/Teams alerts integration
□ Cost forecasting with Prophet
□ Agent-to-agent negotiation protocol
